msgctxt "settings"
msgid "How thinking blocks should be displayed by default. 'Auto' fully expands during streaming, then auto-collapses when done. 'Preview' auto-expands with a height constraint during streaming. 'Always Expanded' shows full content. 'Always Collapsed' keeps them collapsed."
