msgid "The dock that holds two panels (stacked vertically in the left and right docks, side by side in the bottom dock) when a project is opened for the first time. The dock itself is not opened (whether it opens on startup is set by each panel's \"Starts Open\"). After that, the layout saved for each project takes precedence."
msgstr "第一次開啟專案時容納兩個面板的停駐區（在左側與右側停駐區中垂直並列，在底部停駐區中左右並列）。停駐區本身不會開啟（啟動時是否開啟，由各面板的「啟動時開啟」設定）。之後，以各專案儲存的版面配置為優先。"

msgctxt "settings"
msgid "The external AI providers you enabled after accepting the training risk warning. Revoking consent shows the warning again the next time that provider is used."
msgstr "在接受模型訓練風險警告後啟用的外部 AI 提供者。撤回同意後，下次使用該提供者時會再次顯示警告。"

msgctxt "settings"
msgid "The file name of new logs. `{date}` `{time}` `{title}` `{host}` `{pid}` are expanded."
msgstr "新記錄的檔案名稱。會展開 `{date}` `{time}` `{title}` `{host}` `{pid}`。"

msgctxt "settings"
msgid "The folder log files are written to (`~` is expanded). When empty, logs are saved to `terminal-sessions` in Zed's log folder."
msgstr "寫入記錄檔的資料夾（會展開 `~`）。留空時，記錄會儲存到 ForgeKairos 記錄資料夾中的 `terminal-sessions`。"

msgctxt "settings"
msgid "The font fallbacks to use for rendering in text buffers."
msgstr "在文字緩衝區中轉譯時使用的後援字型。"

msgctxt "settings"
msgid "The font fallbacks to use for rendering in the UI."
msgstr "在 UI 中轉譯時使用的後援字型。"

msgctxt "settings"
msgid "The icon theme to use when mode is set to dark, or when mode is set to system and it is in dark mode."
msgstr "當模式設定為深色，或模式設定為系統且系統處於深色模式時使用的圖示佈景主題。"

msgctxt "settings"
msgid "The icon theme to use when mode is set to light, or when mode is set to system and it is in light mode."
msgstr "當模式設定為淺色，或模式設定為系統且系統處於淺色模式時使用的圖示佈景主題。"

msgctxt "settings"
msgid "The language of Zed's menus, settings and messages. Some text, such as tab titles, switches after a restart."
msgstr "ForgeKairos 的選單、設定與訊息所使用的語言。部分文字（例如分頁標題）會在重新啟動後切換。"

msgctxt "settings"
msgid "The largest outline sent for a large attached file. When it does not fit, the most deeply nested symbols are left out first. Values below 512 are treated as 512."
msgstr "附加大型檔案時傳送之大綱的大小上限。放不下時，會先省略巢狀最深的符號。小於 512 的值會視為 512。"

msgctxt "settings"
msgid "The list of language servers to use (or disable) for this language."
msgstr "此語言要使用（或停用）的語言伺服器清單。"

msgctxt "settings"
msgid "The maximum number of tokens to generate."
msgstr "要產生的最大 Token 數。"

msgctxt "settings"
msgid "The minimum APCA perceptual contrast between foreground and background colors (0-106)."
msgstr "前景與背景顏色之間的最小 APCA 感知對比度（0-106）。"

msgctxt "settings"
msgid "The minimum APCA perceptual contrast to maintain when rendering text over highlight backgrounds."
msgstr "在醒目提示背景上顯示文字時維持的最小 APCA 感知對比度。"

msgctxt "settings"
msgid "The minimum column at which to display inline diagnostics."
msgstr "顯示內嵌診斷的最小欄號。"

msgctxt "settings"
msgid "The minimum column number at which to show the inline blame information."
msgstr "顯示內嵌 blame 資訊的最小欄號。"

msgctxt "settings"
msgid "The minimum width (in columns) at which the split diff view is used. When the editor is narrower, the diff view automatically switches to unified mode. Set to 0 to disable."
msgstr "使用並排差異檢視的最小寬度（以欄為單位）。當編輯器較窄時，差異檢視會自動切換為內嵌顯示模式。設為 0 可停用。"

msgctxt "settings"
msgid "The model string to pass to the OpenAI-compatible server."
msgstr "傳遞給 OpenAI 相容伺服器的模型字串。"

msgctxt "settings"
msgid "The multiplier for scrolling in the terminal with the mouse wheel"
msgstr "在終端機中使用滑鼠滾輪捲動的倍數"

msgctxt "settings"
msgid "The name of a base set of key bindings to use."
msgstr "要使用的基本按鍵繫結集合名稱。"

msgctxt "settings"
msgid "The name of your selected icon theme."
msgstr "已選取圖示佈景主題的名稱。"

msgctxt "settings"
msgid "The name of your selected theme."
msgstr "已選取佈景主題的名稱。"

msgctxt "settings"
msgid "The number of characters to keep on either side when scrolling with the mouse."
msgstr "使用滑鼠捲動時，兩側保留的字元數。"

msgctxt "settings"
msgid "The number of lines to keep above/below the cursor when auto-scrolling."
msgstr "自動捲動時，游標上方/下方保留的行數。"

msgctxt "settings"
msgid "The page shown first when a built-in browser panel or tab opens. It can also be set with the pin button on the browser toolbar."
msgstr "開啟內建瀏覽器面板或分頁時最先顯示的頁面。也可以使用瀏覽器工具列上的釘選按鈕設定。"

msgctxt "settings"
msgid "The panel shown next to the first one. Choose \"Don't Stack\" to show a single panel, as upstream Zed does."
msgstr "顯示在第一個面板旁邊的面板。選擇「不並列」可如上游 Zed 一樣只顯示單一面板。"

msgctxt "settings"
msgid "The panel that fills that dock. Choose \"Don't Stack\" to skip building the initial layout."
msgstr "填滿該停駐區的面板。選擇「不並列」可略過建立初始版面配置。"

msgctxt "settings"
msgid "The prompt format to use when requesting predictions. Set to Infer to have the format inferred based on the model name."
msgstr "要求預測時使用的提示格式。設定為「推斷」可根據模型名稱自動推斷格式。"

msgctxt "settings"
msgid "The proxy to use for network requests."
msgstr "網路要求所使用的 Proxy。"

msgctxt "settings"
msgid "The shell program to run."
msgstr "要執行的 Shell 程式。"

msgctxt "settings"
msgid "The shell program to use."
msgstr "要使用的 Shell 程式。"

msgctxt "settings"
msgid "The smallest context window (in tokens) of a model that auto compaction runs for. Models below it are never compacted and only show the token limit warning. Lower it to get auto compaction with the small contexts of local LLMs. Values below 8000 are treated as 8000."
msgstr "執行自動壓縮之模型的最小上下文視窗（Token 數）。低於此值的模型永遠不會壓縮，只會顯示 Token 上限警告。若要在本機 LLM 的小型上下文中使用自動壓縮，請調低此值。小於 8000 的值會視為 8000。"

msgctxt "settings"
msgid "The text rendering mode to use."
msgstr "要使用的文字轉譯模式。"

msgctxt "settings"
msgid "The theme to use when mode is set to dark, or when mode is set to system and it is in dark mode."
msgstr "模式設為深色時，或模式設為系統且系統為深色模式時使用的佈景主題。"

msgctxt "settings"
msgid "The theme to use when mode is set to light, or when mode is set to system and it is in light mode."
msgstr "模式設為淺色時，或模式設為系統且系統為淺色模式時使用的佈景主題。"

msgctxt "settings"
msgid "The unit for image file sizes."
msgstr "影像檔案大小的單位。"

msgctxt "settings"
msgid "The width of the active indent guide in pixels, between 1 and 10."
msgstr "作用中縮排輔助線的寬度（像素），範圍為 1 到 10。"

msgctxt "settings"
msgid "The width of the indent guides in pixels, between 1 and 10."
msgstr "縮排輔助線的寬度（像素），範圍為 1 到 10。"

